<title>UK: Morgan Stanley sets warrants on MIB-30 index.</title>
<headline>Morgan Stanley sets warrants on MIB-30 index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley (Jersey) Ltd has issued 60 million American-style call and put warrants, in six equal tranches, on the MIB-30 index, lead manager Morgan Stanley</p>
<p>&amp; Co International Ltd said.</p>
<p> WARRANTS    STRIKE    ISS PRICE	PREMIUM	GEARING</p>
<p> CALL A	20,000    1,405.00 ITL   16.33 PCT    13.10 TIMES</p>
<p> CALL B	21,000    1,052.OO ITL   19.85 PCT    17.50 TIMES</p>
<p> CALL C	22,000	770.00 ITL   23.75 PCT    23.90 TIMES</p>
<p> PUT D	 18,000    1,316.00 ITL    9.33 PCT    14.00 TIMES</p>
<p> PUT E	 17,000	944.00 ITL   12.74 PCT    19.50 TIMES</p>
<p> PUT F	 16,000	671.00 ITL   16.69 PCT    27.40 TIMES</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   20.MAR.98		 PAYDATE	20.FEB.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   LUX			 MIN EXER LOT 1,000</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
